WK1-PM1 – Cybersecurity Testing Lab Setup
1. Project Overview

As part of Week 1 of the Networkwalks Cybersecurity Program, the task was to set up a virtual cybersecurity testing laboratory for practicing ethical hacking and penetration-testing techniques.

The provided setup instructions were designed around VirtualBox on Windows. Since my laptop uses an Apple M2 processor and macOS, I implemented the laboratory using UTM with an ARM64-compatible Kali Linux virtual machine.

The existing Kali Linux VM was used because it already contained important university files and configurations.

